WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Even exposing the tea petals is a matter of course

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:07,330
Ah, you are saying that this hairpin was not in your hand the whole time

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:10,250
Didn’t I just say it? It’s a joke.

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:13,250
How could I be so stupid as to give away something that passed through my own hands?

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:19,340
What I'm guarding against is you crazy girls like Wang Liang.

6
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:21,640
Why did Ershen call me just to sweep over?

7
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:25,240
Those who didn’t know about this battle would have thought it was a three-party trial.

8
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:29,930
No, I'm just asking to see if there are any clues.

9
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:32,430
The relationship between Shen Chao and Shen Yan has never been good.

10
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,730
I thought she was eager to see Song Yu make a fool of herself

11
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:36,920
Why are you still here to protect her?

12
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:39,940
There are many younger brothers and sisters who can save Ershen in the whole house.

13
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:43,440
During the meeting when I was under the quilt, all but one was given to me.

14
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:45,840
The rest was sent to the second room.

15
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:48,420
Why did something happen to the sixth sister alone?

16
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,820
If the two gods think there is something fishy about this matter,

17
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,720
It’s better to expose it immediately
